    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A large five-bedroom detached dormer bungalow set on a private site in the countryside at Cruicetown, close to Nobber.\r\n\r\nOffered fully furnished, the home provides five bedrooms and four bathrooms, with a good mix of living and bedroom space across two floors. The size and layout make it a great fit for family life, with plenty of room for day-to-day living and guests.\r\n\r\nOutside, the property sits on a large private site with a generous garden, detached garage and ample parking. Electric entrance gates add privacy and give the home a strong sense of separation from the road.\r\n\r\nThe property holds a B energy rating and benefits from oil fired central heating.\r\n\r\nThe location is another key strength. You get the space and privacy of a countryside setting while staying within easy reach of Nobber, with good access to Kingscourt, Kells and Navan. Schools, shops, sports clubs and day-to-day services are all within reach.\r\n\r\nA strong rental option for a family looking for a furnished detached home with plenty of space inside and out.\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\n\r\n- Five bedrooms\r\n- Four bathrooms\r\n- Detached dormer bungalow\r\n- Fully furnished\r\n- B energy rating\r\n- Large private garden\r\n- Detached garage\r\n- Electric entrance gates\r\n- Oil fired central heating\r\n- Ample parking\r\n- Countryside setting\r\n- Good access to Nobber, Kingscourt, Kells and Navan\r\n\r\nTo Apply\r\n\r\nTo apply or request full details, please email info@keenanauctioneers.com with landlord and s, photo ID, contact number, and details of intended occupants.\r\n\r\nPlease note that pets are not permitted under the terms of the tenancy."
      },
